@startuml
title Renting School Facility - Sequence Diagram

actor Renter
participant Website as Website
participant "School Staff" as Staff
participant "Payment Service" as Pay
participant "Email Service" as Email

Renter -> Website: Submit request
Website -> Website: Check availability
Website -> Staff: Review request

alt#Gold #LightBlue approved
    Staff --> Website: Approve request
    Website -> Pay: Process payment
    alt#Gold #LightBlue payment succeeds
        Website -> Website: Save booking
        Website -> Email: Send confirmation email
        Email --> Renter: Confirmation Email
    else #Pink payment fails
        Website -> Website: Record failure
        Website -> Email: Send failure email
        Email --> Renter: Failure Email
else #Pink rejected
    Staff --> Website: Reject request
    Website -> Website: Record rejection
    Website -> Email: Send rejection email
    Email --> Renter: Rejection email

@enduml